&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3999&quot;&gt;Enough hands-on depth to challenge weak designs on their merits; this is a security leader who stays technically credible, not purely managerial.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
